    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20218" root="سكر" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكْرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَكْرَانُ</span>: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكْرٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  Also <i>A certain herb,</i> or <i>leguminous plant,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَقْلَةٌ</span>,) <i>of such as
are termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْرَار</span> [pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُرٌّ</span>], (Aboo-Nasr, K,)
<i>which is of the best of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُقُول</span>: (TA as from the
K: [but not in my MS. copy of the K nor in the
CK:]) AHn says that no description of its
general attributes or qualities had come to his
knowledge. (TA.)

